{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not make MDC snapshot failures terminal workflow failures.** An ordinary `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` failure occurs before hooks or user code, but this routes it through `finishFailure` and emits durable `FAILED`. Treat capture as best-effort with a safe baseline, or propagate it as a retryable invocation failure without a terminal response.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77sbw-","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":291,"observation_digest":"f1446439cf79e178e855afe794ca0210150ebe100958460657983f65a2d5b93d","observation_id":"aro_v1_6fcgioopphqxr2cvv7tzjsqcca","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T18:31:16Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3ad56x3tucxpdx6v3vndafnqmc","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"40597b3393d2260883ae37b45d978685d2144a31","reviewer":"codex","start_line":290,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_mrvhptwwyf36l3kwjj7b4hiz7o","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T18:31:16Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
